  "prompt": "How many users reached each step of the month-end close funnel in the app? Use all app events, which cover the accounts with app events from October to December 2025. A user counts as uploaded with an upload_statement event, as matched with a match_transaction event, and as exported with an export_report event; a user counts at a step only when the user also reached every step before it, in any order. Return three columns, in this order: uploaded, matched and exported, each a number of users. Return one row. Any row order is fine.",
